  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Egypt Delegation(2024 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Egypt, the ICRC promotes respect for international humanitarian law in the member countries of the League of Arab States. The delegation has also worked with the Egyptian Red Crescent to help people uprooted by the Libya conflict and provided first aid to people injured in violence within Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
